w) Report introduced.   (Athens: Lester Holt) The day\u2019s events at the Olympic Games in Athens, Greece, reviewed; details given about the USOC\u2019s request that President Bush\u2019s re-election ad mixing politics & athletics be pulled; Bush ad shown. Results, including those for women\u2019s soccer & women\u2019s water polo, reported.   (Athens: Rehema Ellis) The new generation of American track stars featured; scenes shown of Allyson Felix&#134;, Jeremy Wariner&#134;&#134;, Justin Gatlin&#134;&#134; and Shawn Crawford&#134;; details given of the doping scandal surrounding the sport. [\u201cSports Illustrated\u201d Tim LAYDEN&#134;- says they need to represent the sport better than the generation that\u2019s going out.] [FELIX \u2013 comments on the passion of the young people.] [Crawford\u2019s mother Sylvia CRAWFORD&#134; \u2013 comments on her son\u2019s speed.] [CRAWFORD \u2013 says it\u2019s our job to prove this is a clean sport.]   (Athens: Lester Holt) The stripping of the bronze medal from the Ukrainian women\u2019s rowing team due to a doping violation reported.", "segment_duration": 250, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64080.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763550, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "R4UfLLVSp6", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 763538, "segment_id": "SxLq52tyLH", "segment_broadcast_id": "R4UfLLVSp6", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Tom Brokaw)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64330.0", "legacy_segment_id": 763551, "network_name": "NBC", "bro